    "show_share": true,
    "description": "To acknowledge the contributions and role of donors in the development of AKU, the Sports and Rehabilitation Centre (SRC) Donors Family Day was held on August 19, 2001 at AKU. The objective was to provide the donors of the SRC, and their families, an opportunity to visit the facility established with their generous contributions.",
